### **Tabuler Geography Filter**
The Table data filter is used for tabuler analysis of the ACS data. This analysis usually result in tables with comparisons. Example of those tables can be found in Regional Transportation Plan and Title VI Plan. The tabuler filter will include National, State, County, and City numbers.   
- For example: ``United States`` ``Oregon`` ``Jackson County`` ``All RVMPO Cities``, see the screehshot below.
   
